  "reflectionText": "Jeremiah wrote to the captives at Babylon: build houses, plant gardens, take wives, seek the peace of the city. I know the thoughts that I think toward you, thoughts of peace and not of evil. What is it to be told to settle in a city you did not want to come to, because the One who sent you has thoughts of peace toward you in that very place?"
}
